# Reviewed AI-only additions shared by BOTH Shadowrocket AI and v2rayN.
# Format SERVICE,DOMAIN,EXACT-HOST. Never add whole Google APIs/CDN/analytics suffixes.
# Gemini: an official firewall ALLOWLIST is not an AI-only proxy list.
# Shared Google login/CDN/Fonts/Play/People/OAuth hosts are intentionally excluded;
# those requests fall through to the original Johnshall rules.
# Only two narrowly scoped Gemini App helper hosts remain (still not exclusive).
# Official reference: https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
GEMINI,DOMAIN,jnn-pa.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com
# Gemini Code Assist primary AI endpoints come from the reviewed community feeds.
# Its shared login/Cloud APIs do not override the baseline geographic routes.
# Reference: https://cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/codeassist/set-up-gemini
# Claude Code network requirements; core anthropic.com/claude.ai covered by suffix.
# Exact optional error reporting: never route the generic datadoghq.com suffix.
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,api.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,platform.claude.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,mcp-proxy.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,downloads.claude.ai
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,assets-proxy.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,bridge.claudeusercontent.com
# Claude Code optional error reports, Anthropic-documented exact host only.
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
